---
layout: base.njk
description: "Simon Stafferton works on technical SEO, analytics and direct-booking conversion for student accommodation and build-to-rent operators."
---

<section class="wrap hero">
  <h1 class="hero__statement">
    I make housing websites <em>findable</em>, and I make the numbers behind them
    trustworthy.
  </h1>

  <p class="hero__sub">
    Twenty years in digital, the last ten of them almost entirely in student
    accommodation and build-to-rent. Technical SEO, analytics that actually
    reconcile, and the unglamorous work of getting more people to book direct.
  </p>

  <div class="hero__actions">
    <a class="button" href="/book/">Book a call</a>
    <a class="textlink" href="/about/">More about how I work</a>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="wrap section">
  <div class="section__head">
    <h2>Writing</h2>
  </div>

  <ul class="entries">
    {% for post in collections.posts | reverse %}
      {% if loop.index0 < 4 %}
        <li class="entry">
          <span class="entry__date">
            <time datetime="{{ post.date | isoDate }}">{{ post.date | displayDate }}</time>
          </span>
          <div>
            <h3 class="entry__title">
              <a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a>
            </h3>
            {% if post.data.excerpt %}
              <p class="entry__excerpt">{{ post.data.excerpt }}</p>
            {% endif %}
          </div>
        </li>
      {% endif %}
    {% endfor %}
  </ul>

  <p style="margin-block-start:2rem">
    <a class="textlink" href="/blog/">Everything I have written</a>
  </p>
</section>

<section class="wrap section">
  <div class="section__head">
    <h2>Things I have built</h2>
    <p class="lede" style="margin-block-start:0.75rem">
      Mostly tools I wanted for my own work and then kept going with.
    </p>
  </div>

  <ul class="projects">
    <li class="project">
      <h3 class="project__name"><a href="https://abexis.app">ABexis</a></h3>
      <p class="project__what">
        A/B testing rendered at the edge, so your experiments stop wrecking your
        Core Web Vitals.
      </p>
    </li>
    <li class="project">
      <h3 class="project__name">
        <a href="https://directorsdraw.uk">Directors Draw</a>
      </h3>
      <p class="project__what">
        A calculator for UK company directors working out what they actually take
        home across salary, dividends and pension.
      </p>
    </li>
    <li class="project">
      <h3 class="project__name">
        <a href="https://abtests.co.uk">abtests.co.uk</a>
      </h3>
      <p class="project__what">
        Notes on conversion rate optimisation, with the examples playable rather
        than described.
      </p>
    </li>
  </ul>

  <p style="margin-block-start:2rem">
    <a class="textlink" href="/projects/">The rest of them</a>
  </p>
</section>
